  "question": {
    "text": "When a train approaches a stationary observer, the apparent frequency of the whistle is <math><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>′</mi></mrow></msup></math> and when the same train recedes away from the observer, the apparent frequency is&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>′</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></msup></math>. The apparent frequency&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>, when the observer moves with the train is"
  },
